where we think that the speech vocal

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:57.190
learning circuits in our brain and these
birds evolved by duplicating the pathway

00:00:57.190 --> 00:01:01.960
that controls other body parts and now
hooking it up to the voice instead of

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.720
learning how to walk learning how to
talk so basically the vocal learning

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:15.580
circuit is a motor learning circuit and
in terms of who has it and why so few

